## HI-01 — ALREADY CLOSED

`apps/api/src/auth.ts:430` reads `baseURL: validateIngressBoot().ingressBaseUrl`.
`grep -n 'localhost:3000' apps/api/src/auth.ts` returns NO match in the
`baseURL` position (no match at all). `grep -n 'ingressBaseUrl'` shows the
literal `?? "http://localhost:3000"` fallback the finding reported is GONE.

Closure: Phase 57 Track E added `validateIngressBoot()` (`config/auth.ts`),
which refuses boot (exit 78) when neither `INGRESS_BASE_URL` nor `AUTH_URL`
is set, and refuses non-HTTPS under `NODE_ENV=production`.

Disposition: **CLOSED (already-resolved)** — Phase 57 Track E. No fix in
Phase 62.

