## HI-05 — STILL LIVE → FIXED (Option B)

`apps/api/src/lib/token-rotation.ts:162` follow-up
`SELECT email FROM users WHERE id = ${first.user_id}::uuid` ran with NO
`withTenant()` binding and NO `tenant_id` predicate.

Fix-shape determination (Task 6.1): **Option B (`AND tenant_id` predicate)**
chosen over Option A (`withTenant()` wrap). Option A requires widening the
`tryPreviousToken` `db` param from the minimal `{ execute }` shape to
`TransactionalDb<ExecutableTx>`, which ripples to 5 minimal-shape unit-test
fakes in `token-rotation.test.ts`. Option B is the clean api-core-side fix:
no `db`-type change, no caller ripple, no migration. The follow-up SELECT
now carries `AND tenant_id = ${first.tenant_id}::uuid`. NOT a HALT —
Option B is cleanly achievable.

Disposition: **FIXED — Phase 62 commit aa28c391** (Option B predicate).
